{"about_the_game":"The Possessor(s) demo is a fast-paced action side scroller with combat inspired by platform fighters, set in Sanzu City, a metropolis ruled by a sinister megacorporation.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712530/extras/Possessors_bridgerun.gif?t=1749253904\" /><br><br>In this demo, escape a sprawling, flooded city overrun with surreal interdimensional horror. Learn combat basics, explore the Skyscraper and Campus areas, and watch Luca and Rhem establish their difficult alliance.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712530/extras/Possessors_combat.gif?t=1749253904\" /><br><br>Play as Luca, a teenage girl who survived a catastrophic demon attack on Sanzu\u2014and Rhem, a demon who earned his freedom by escaping from Sanzu\u2019s deepest laboratories. The demons escaped, ripping the city apart, and nearly killed them both. Their only hope of survival lies in learning to co-exist.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712530?t=1749253904","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712530?t=1749253904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712530/40f2c412bedd6b78548ae7a2f89ea23d40e1578b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749253904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712530/40f2c412bedd6b78548ae7a2f89ea23d40e1578b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749253904","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"The Possessor(s) demo is a fast-paced action side scroller with combat inspired by platform fighters, set in Sanzu City, a metropolis ruled by a sinister megacorporation.<